WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.300
Build a show from scenes, live sources and overlays. Single-canvas edits go
straight to output.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:13.900
Enable Studio mode: prepare the next scene in Preview while Program stays
live.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:22.100
Fade takes the prepared scene to Program.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:29.800
Record Program independently using the same composed scene.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:36.600
Private break replaces Program with a slate while recording continues.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:44.200
Resume the show, then stop recording to finalize the file.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.470
Scenes, sources and the saved show remain ready for the next production.
